        "explanation": "Doctor provides a structured one‐month action list covering chlorhexidine, blood pressure logging, left‐kidney nodule follow‐up, and explicit emergency triggers.",
        "quote": "我帮您把接下来一个月的安排梳理清楚，您照着做就不会遗漏"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Doctor flags that chlorhexidine is an antihypertensive but also reduces proteinuria/protects the kidney; they condition continuation on BP and renal function.",
        "quote": "氯沙坦钾确实是降压药，同时它也可以减少蛋白尿、保护肾脏，只要您血压不低（收缩压高于90mmHg），规范服用不会伤肾"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
