        "quote": "我已经帮您登记了随访提醒，到时间会提示您"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00270",
        "explanation": "Doctor explicitly lists red‐flag criteria including hypotension (90/60), fever, worsening back pain, gross haematuria, and re‐appearance of milky urine.",
        "quote": "如果复诊前突然出现头晕明显、血压降得很低，或者发烧、腰痛加重、尿里血块变多、米汤样尿又变得很严重"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00434",
        "explanation": "Doctor advises the patient that a family member can help book a urinary surgery or convenience clinic appointment for B‐mode ultrasound, reducing the patient's own travel burden.",
        "quote": "您可以这两天就让家人帮您在泌尿外科或者便民门诊预约肾脏B超"
      }
    ]
  },
