        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00434",
          "explanation": "The doctor proposes instead of an immediate in‐person visit, to use a convenience outpatient or surgical booking and to bring old CT films; this converts the friction into a low‐travel plan.",
          "quote": "您可以这两天就让家人帮您在泌尿外科或者便民门诊预约肾脏B超"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
