        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00434",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly assigns the long‐term antihypertensive management to the community chronic disease clinic or cardiology, and the left‐kidney nodule to urology, repairing the ownership gap.",
          "quote": "长期方案确实需要找原来给您开氯沙坦的医生，或者社区卫生服务中心的慢病门诊、心内科门诊来调整定案"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00270",
          "explanation": "The doctor states that if the patient cannot reach the original surgeon, the same‐team urologist can handle the follow‐up, closing the responsibility chain.",
          "quote": "如果1-2周内实在挂不到主刀医生的号，挂同组泌尿外科医生复诊是完全可以的"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model identified the broken handoff (medication confusion, no assigned follow‐up) and repaired it by naming the community/cardiology doctor for antihypertensive and the urology team for the nodule, and by offering same‐team surgeon as a fallback.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
