          "event_id": "lite_evt_00009",
          "explanation": "The doctor queries the workspace for discharge records, preoperative/postoperative labs, and medication orders to ground the advice.",
          "quote": "我需要调取CareLoop联合医疗网络中已授权、已同步的这份左侧肾周围淋巴管结扎手术的出院记录、术前术后相关检查结果（包括肾功能、影像学报告）、术前术后用药清单以及本次住院的完整病历资料"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor actively requested and reviewed both the discharge summary and medication lists, and explicitly acknowledged that without the full record they could not make definitive statements; no serious fabrication occurred.",
