          "explanation": "The doctor asked the patient to list all current medications, including drug name, dose, frequency, start time, and remaining quantity.",
          "quote": "要求患者列出现正在吃、手头剩余和出院新开的所有药物，包括药名、剂量、频次、开始时间和剩余量"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model separated perioperative antibiotics from outpatient chronic medications, flagged the uncertain chlorhexidine status, and told the patient not to self‐aggregate, meeting all RC2 evidence.",
