          "quote": "如果您现在再次出现尿液发白、血尿或者腰痛、发热这些不舒服，要立刻去就近医院急诊就诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model enquired about all cardinal postoperative risk signals including haematuria, fever, pain, and urinary retention, and gave clear emergency instructions; no serious omission occurred.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
