          "quote": "到时候就跟他说查肾功能、尿常规、泌尿系超声，顺便看左肾结节，对吧？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model explicitly planned urine/renal function follow‐up and directed the left‐kidney‐nodule imaging to urology; no determination of benignity without follow‐up was made.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
